OL,3,GNEWSAFilmmakers to keep momentum going
OL,4,Awith new short
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo filmmakers hope to "keep the
OL,7,Fmomentum going" after submitting their
OL,8,Fwork to a number of Bafta-qualifying
OL,9,Ffilm festivals.
OL,11,FWriter and director David Higgs and
OL,12,Fproducer Fraya Locke created the
OL,13,F22-minute short Three Blue Boats two
OL,14,Fyears ago while studying at Falmouth
OL,15,FSchool of Film and Television in
OL,16,FCornwall.
OL,18,FHiggs described the piece, which
OL,19,Ffollows two brothers left to fend for
OL,20,Fthemselves when their parents
OL,21,Fdisappear, as "an allegory of neglect,
OL,22,Fchildhood and family".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
