OL,3,GNEWSAFilmmakers to keep momentum going
OL,4,Awith new short
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe work has since premiered at the
OL,7,FBolton International Film Festival,
OL,8,Fbeen selected for a number of Bafta and
OL,9,FBritish Independent Film
OL,10,FAwards-qualifying festivals and is
OL,11,Fbeing screened at the Cornwall Film
OL,12,FFestival.
